<title>INDIA: SOCCER-GHANA AND CHINA DRAW 0-0 IN NEHRU GOLD CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GHANA AND CHINA DRAW 0-0 IN NEHRU GOLD CUP.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana and China drew 0-0 in</p>
<p>a preliminary league match of the five-nation Nehru Gold Cup</p>
<p>international soccer tournament on Thursday.</p>
</text>
